  "card_notes": [
   "No post-processing. In cross-validation, 7 of 38 held-out masks had detached pieces of 695 voxels or fewer in total; keeping only the largest component (linc_seg.predict --postprocess largest_component) would change 11 masks: it raised Dice in 8 (by up to 0.0034), lowered it in 3 (by less than 0.0001) and never raised HD95 (lowered by up to 0.36 mm).",
   "The masks of record (all 38 held-out ones) leave enclosed interior spaces unfilled, so hole filling contradicts them: largest component with fill (largest_cc_fill) lowered Dice in 33 of 38 held-out masks (median -0.0013) and raised HD95 by a median 1.7 mm."
  ],
